  "question": "The coefficient of static friction between the tyres and a flat road is $0.4$. The maximum speed with which a car can go round a flat curve of radius $40$ m without skidding is ($g = 10\\ \\text{m/s}^2$)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
