  "solution": "$$v_{max} = \\sqrt{\\mu rg} = \\sqrt{0.4 \\times 40 \\times 10} = \\sqrt{160} = 4\\sqrt{10}\\ \\text{m/s} \\approx 12.6\\ \\text{m/s}$$",
